<title>ESTONIA: HOIU INSURANCE GETS 14.05 MLN PREMIUMS IN FEB. [CORRECTED 10:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>HOIU INSURANCE GETS 14.05 MLN PREMIUMS IN FEB. [CORRECTED 10:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The insurance arm of Hoiupank, Eesti Kindlustus, collected 14.05 million kroons of premiums in February (corrects from 14.5 million kroons), Hoiupank said on Friday.</p>
<p>Of the total premiums collected in February, 76 percent was general insurance and 24 percent was life insurance, the bank added.</p>
<p>Eesti Kindlustus' share of the life insurance market was two percent higher in February, giving it 50 percent of the market.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn Newsroom +372 630 8400</p>
</text>
